    "第三单元 结尾"
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "Life in Space",
      "cn": "第 39 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "Life in space is much different from life on the earth.",
      "cn": "太空生活与地球上的生活很不一样。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "How do astronauts live in space?",
      "cn": "宇航员怎样在太空中生活呢？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "Many years ago, astronauts could eat only small pieces of dried food.",
      "cn": "许多年前，宇航员只能吃小块的干粮。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "But now astronauts are able to eat more everyday food like fruit, vegetables and ice cream.",
      "cn": "但是现在，宇航员能够吃更多日常食物，比如水果、蔬菜和冰激凌。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "All the people in space have their own rooms.",
      "cn": "太空中的所有人都有自己的房间。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "They have to tie themselves to their beds or toilets, or they'll fly away!",
      "cn": "他们必须把自己系在床上或马桶上，否则就会飞走！",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "That seems like a strange way to sleep, but astronauts say it really isn't too bad.",
      "cn": "那看起来像是一种奇怪的睡觉方式，但宇航员说其实并不太糟。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "Astronauts can read books, play cards, listen to music or send emails to their friends and families when they aren't working.",
      "cn": "宇航员不工作时，可以读书、打牌、听音乐，或给朋友和家人发电子邮件。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "Sometimes they just sit and look out of the spaceship.",
      "cn": "有时他们只是坐着向宇宙飞船外看。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "Astronauts are hard-working whether in space or on the earth.",
      "cn": "无论在太空还是在地球上，宇航员都很勤奋。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "Though the work is sometimes difficult, they are still interested in it and love their jobs.",
      "cn": "虽然工作有时很困难，但他们仍然对它感兴趣并热爱自己的工作。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "en": "Many people agree that astronauts' lives are very interesting and they dream of becoming astronauts.",
      "cn": "许多人同意宇航员的生活非常有趣，他们梦想成为宇航员。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
